<title>POLAND: ELEKTROBUDOWA SEPT NET UP TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROBUDOWA SEPT NET UP TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.45 vs   0.18</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.53 vs   0.36</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.59 vs   0.50</p>
<p> Sales		   20.52 vs  17.29</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    11.70 vs   6.93</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	21.01 vs  11.23</p>
<p> Operating profit    22.42 vs  13.19</p>
<p> Sales		  163.91 vs 116.49</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Elektrobudowa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
